231	     * A steward moves a DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING claim to another person on the sheet. The claim keeps its
232	     * number and date, is released from any figure a statement bound it to (live again until its new
233	     * person's next statement), and lists as its new person's newest claim. A settled or voided claim, a
234	     * correction, a claim dated inside a closed period or after the new person's retirement date, or a move
235	     * by anyone but a steward is refused and nothing changes. Returns the people it moved from and to.
236	     */
237	    @Transactional
238	    public long[] reassign(String sheetId, String user, long claimId, long toPersonId) {
239	        Claim claim = claim(sheetId, claimId);
240	        if (access.roleOf(sheetId, user) != Role.STEWARD) {
241	            throw new ResponseStatusException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT, "Only a steward can reassign a claim");
242	        }
243	        if (claim.getStatus() != ClaimStatus.DRAFT && claim.getStatus() != ClaimStatus.OPEN
244	                && claim.getStatus() != ClaimStatus.PENDING) {
