299	     * sheet's today is on or after it, the next in the period its date falls in (<period name>-<n>), or
300	     * in the sequence of claims in no period (X-<n>); otherwise the next sheet-wide number. Two users
301	     * taking one at the same moment wait on each other, so no number is given twice or skipped.
302	     */
303	    private void giveNumber(String sheetId, Claim claim) {
